Gemini as unconfigured\n- **Also Referenced**: Test mode in packages/api/src/routers/system.test.ts:22\n\n### `NANO_BANANA_API_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ❌ NOT in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: Not yet implemented (planned for avatar generation)\n- **Purpose**: Nano Banana API for image style transformation\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Avatar generation will fail when implemented\n- **Mentioned In**: CLAUDE.md:127, docs/cloud-setup-guide.md:35\n\n---\n\n## Payment Providers\n\n### Stripe (Web Payments)\n\n#### `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example` (`stripe-test-secret`)\n- **Used By**: Backend Stripe operations\n- **Purpose**: Server-side Stripe API authentication\n- **Features Affected Without It**:\n  - Subscription creation fails\n  - Credit pack purchases fail\n  - Webhook processing fails\n\n#### `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example` (`stripe-test-webhook`)\n- **Used By**: packages/api/src/routers/stripeWebhook.ts, docs/stories/story-6-5.md:57\n- **Purpose**: Validates webhook signatures from Stripe\n- **Features Affected Without It**:\n  - Webhook events fail verification\n  - Subscription status updates fail\n  - Payment confirmations fail\n\n#### `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: Client-side Stripe.js initialization\n- **Purpose**: Client-side Stripe API authentication for collecting payment details securely.\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Web checkout UI cannot load, payment collection fails.\n\n#### `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_1_CREDIT`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example` (`replace_with_stripe_price_id_for_1_credit`)\n- **Used By**: apps/web/app/purchase/page.tsx:23\n- **Purpose**: Stripe Price ID for 1-credit pack ($0.99)\n- **Features Affected Without It**: 1-credit purchase option fails\n- **Default Fallback**: `'price_1story'`\n\n#### `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_5_CREDIT`\n- **Current 