# Monitoring & Observability\n\n### Sentry (Error Tracking)\n\n#### `SENTRY_DSN`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**:\n  - scripts/delete-expired-photos.mjs:34-36\n  - packages/utils/src/monitoring.ts:30 (with fallback to `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`)\n- **Purpose**: Sentry project DSN for error reporting\n- **Features Affected Without It**: No error tracking, blind to production issues\n\n#### `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ References `${SENTRY_DSN}` in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: Next.js client-side error tracking\n- **Purpose**: Browser error reporting\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Client errors not tracked\n\n#### `EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ References `${SENTRY_DSN}` in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: React Native error tracking\n- **Purpose**: Mobile app error reporting\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Mobile errors not tracked\n\n### PostHog (Analytics)\n\n#### `POSTHOG_API_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: packages/utils/src/monitoring.ts:31 (with fallback to `NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_API_KEY`)\n- **Purpose**: PostHog project API key for analytics\n- **Features Affected Without It**: No user analytics, product insights blind\n\n#### `NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_API_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ References `${POSTHOG_API_KEY}` in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: Web analytics tracking\n- **Purpose**: Browser analytics events\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Web user behavior not tracked\n\n#### `EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_API_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ References `${POSTHOG_API_KEY}` in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: Mobile analytics tracking\n- **Purpose**: Mobile app analytics events\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Mobile user behavior not tracked\n\n---\n\n## Alerting & Incident Response\n\n### Email Alerting (Resend)\n\n#### `RESEND_API_KEY`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: Email sending services (e.g., cron jobs