lerts\n- **Features Affected Without It**: No on-call escalation\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Test Execution Flags\n\n#### `PHOTO_DELETION_TEST_MODE`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Set to `false` in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: tests/photo-deletion-integration.test.ts:29\n- **Purpose**: Enables photo deletion integration tests\n- **Features Affected Without It**: Tests skipped (safety measure)\n\n#### `SKIP_INTEGRATION_TESTS`\n- **Current Status**: ❌ NOT in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: packages/api/src/routers/avatar.integration.test.ts:101\n- **Purpose**: Skip expensive integration tests in CI\n- **Features Affected Without It**: All integration tests run\n\n### COPPA Consent Webhooks\n\n#### `COPPA_CONSENT_WEBHOOK_URL` / `CONSENT_EVENTS_WEBHOOK_URL`\n- **Current Status**: ❌ NOT in `.env.example`\n- **Used By**: packages/api/src/env.ts:17-18 (checks both names)\n- **Purpose**: External webhook for consent event notifications\n- **Features Affected Without It**: No external consent tracking\n\n### Cron Security\n\n#### `CRON_SECRET`\n- **Current Status**: ✅ Template in `.env.example` (required in all environments)\n- **Used By**: `apps/web/app/api/cron/*` routes and middleware authentication (health-check, photo-deletion, account-deletion, privacy-export)\n- **Purpose**: Authenticates scheduled cron requests; routes fail closed when missing or mismatched\n- **Features Affected Without It**: All cron endpoints return `401 Unauthorized` (no health signal, no deletions/exports)\n- **Security Notes**: Must not be exposed to clients; validated with constant-time compare; rotate immediately if leaked and deploy across Vercel + local envs\n\n---\n\n## Missing Variables\n\nThe following variables were previously missing but have been added to `.env.example`:\n\n### Medium Priority (Development/Testing)\n\n1. **`EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCHAIN_SERVICE`**\n   - **Impact**: Uses hardcoded fallback\n   - **Referenced In**: apps/mobile/app/(auth)/password-reset.tsx:11\n   - **Recommendation**: Add for consistency (low risk as fallback exists)\n\n2. **`SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`**\n   - **Impact**: Consent audit notifications not sent to Slack\n   - **Referenced In**: scripts/consent-compliance-audit.ts:81\n   - **Recommendation**: Add if Slack integration needed\n\n3. **`SKIP_APPLE_VERIFICATION_CHECK`**\n   - **Impact**: None (feature flag for disabling checks)\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/routers/credits.ts:418\n   - **Recommendation**: Document but don't add to `.env.example` (dev-only flag)\n\n4. **`SKIP_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_CHECK`**\n   - **Impact**: None (feature flag for disabling checks)\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/routers/credits.ts:538\n   - **Recommendation**: Document but don't add to `.env.example` (dev-only flag)\n\n5. **`COPPA_CONSENT_WEBHOOK_URL` / `CONSENT_EVENTS_WEBHOOK_URL`**\n   - **Impact**: External consent event tracking disabled\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/env.ts:17-18\n   - **Recommendation**: Add if external consent system required\n\n6. **`PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS`**\n   - **Impact**: None (uses default 36 hours)\n   - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/env.ts:24\n   - **Note**: `.env.example` has `TEMP_UPLOADS_TTL_HOURS` (48), code checks `PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS`\n   - **Recommendation**: Align variable names or add alias\n\n7. **`GIT_SHA` / `API_VERSION`**\n    - **Impact**: Release tracking less accurate\n    - **Referenced In**: packages/api/src/env.ts:20-21\n    - **Recommendation**: Set in CI/CD, not local `.env`\n\n### Low Priority (Auto-Injected or CI-Only)\n\n8. **`VERCEL`** (auto-injected by Vercel)\n9. **`VERCEL_ENV`** (auto-injected by Vercel)\n10. **`VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA`** (auto-injected by Vercel)\n11. **`CI`** (auto-injected by GitHub Actions and other CI systems)\n12. **`TARGET_SHA`** (GitHub Actions workflow variable)\n13. **`DEPLOYMENT_URL`** (GitHub Actions workflow variable)\n14. **`SHARD_INDEX` / `SHARD_TOTAL`** (test parallelization, CI-only)\n\n---\n\n## Variable Status Summary\n\n### ✅ Properly Configured (85 variables)\nAll variables in `.env.example` with templates or defaults.\n\n### ❌ Missing from `.env.example` (7 high/medium priority)\n1. `EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCHAIN_SERVICE`\n2. `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`\n3. `SKIP_APPLE_VERIFICATION_CHECK`\n4. `SKIP_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_CHECK`\n5. `COPPA_CONSENT_WEBHOOK_URL` / `CONSENT_EVENTS_WEBHOOK_URL`\n6. `PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS` (naming mismatch with `TEMP_UPLOADS_TTL_HOURS`)\n7. `GIT_SHA` / `API_VERSION`\n\n### 🔄 Auto-Injected by Platform (7 variables)\n- Vercel: `VERCEL`, `VERCEL_ENV`, `VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA`\n- CI Systems: `CI`, `TARGET_SHA`, `DEPLOYMENT_URL`\n- Test Runners: `SHARD_INDEX`, `SHARD_TOTAL`\n\n---\n\n## Recommendations\n\n### Immediate Actions\n\n1. **Align `PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS` with `TEMP_UPLOADS_TTL_HOURS`**\n   - Option A: Rename `TEMP_UPLOADS_TTL_HOURS` → `PHOTO_DELETION_TTL_HOURS` in `.env.example`\n   - Option B: Add check for both names in code (already done in scripts/storage-lifecycle.mjs:88)\n   - Option C: Add both to `.env.example` with comment explaining they're aliases\n\n### Documentation Improvements\n\n1. **Add variable reference table to README.md**\n2. **Create setup checklist linking to this document**\n3. **Add validation script** to check for missing required variables at startup\n\n### Security Hardening\n\n1. **Rotate all secrets in `.env.example`** - current values look like potential real keys\n2. **Add `.env.local` to `.gitignore`** (verify it's there)\n3. **Document key rotation procedures** (partially in docs/technical/supabase-runbook.md)\n4. **Add runtime validation** for critical variables (fail fast on startup if missing)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference: Environment-Specific Variables\n\n### Local Development (.env.local)\n```env\nNODE_ENV=development\nSUPABASE_URL=${SUPABASE_DEV_URL}\nDATABASE_URL=${SUPABASE_DEV_DB_URL}\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...\nGEMINI_API_KEY=<dev_key>\n```\n\n### CI/CD (GitHub Actions)\n```env\nDATABASE_URL=${GITHUB_SUPABASE_DEV_DB_URL}\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=${GITHUB_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_DEV}\nCI=true\n```\n\n### Vercel Preview\n```env\nVERCEL_ENV=preview\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=${VERCEL_PREVIEW_SUPABASE_URL}\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=${VERCEL_PREVIEW_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY}\n```\n\n### Vercel Production\n```env\nVERCEL_ENV=production\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=${VERCEL_PROD_SUPABASE_URL}\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=${VERCEL_PROD_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY}\nGEMINI_API_KEY=${VERCEL_PROD_GEMINI_API_KEY}\n```\n\n### EAS Mobile Builds\n```env\nEXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=$EAS_SUPABASE_URL\nEXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=$EAS_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=$EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL\n```\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-17\n**Maintained By**: Engineering Team\n**Related Docs**:\n- `.env.example` - Template file\n- `docs/technical/supabase-runbook.md` - Supabase key rotation\n- `docs/PURCHASE_UI_SETUP.md` - Stripe configuration\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Cloud environment requirements\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
